<title>USA: HSBC James Capel names two analysts.</title>
<headline>HSBC James Capel names two analysts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC James Capel said Fabian Abadie and Juan Sommer had joined its Latin American equities research unit as analysts.</p>
<p>The company, a unit of HSBC Holdings Plc, said in a statement that Abadie, 33, would cover the region's conglomerates sector. He will be based in Buenos Aires, Argentina.</p>
<p>Sommer, 30, will follow the region's beverage sector and will be based in Santiago, Chile.</p>
<p>Abadie had worked as a portfolio manager at ING Bank and Sommer had been an analyst at Celfin Servicios Financieros in Santiago.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
